'''Savage Hit''' is a [[keyword]] that refers to [[hit]]s that remove at least 15% of the target's maximum [[life]]. 

==Mechanics==
Savage Hits are determined purely by ''life'' [[loss]], not by [[damage taken]].<ref name="Chaos Inoculation" /> The following do not count toward the Savage Hit threshold:
* Loss of resources other than life (e.g. {{il|Steelskin}}, [[energy shield]], [[mana]], [[ward]])
* Prevented life loss (e.g. {{il|Petrified Blood}})<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/mcqir3/314_league_info_megathread/gu7i5v0/?context=8</ref>
* {{il|Dissolution of the Flesh}}'s life [[reservation]] above current life

